#
# Test the WornOutDummy respawn mechanism
#

# Create test area
@dig/tel Test Respawn Arena
#
# Create a worn-out dummy with fast respawn
@create/drop Test Dummy:typeclasses.objects.WornOutDummy
#
# Set respawn timer to 5 seconds for quick testing
@py self.location.contents[-1].db.respawn_timer = 5
#
# Show initial state
look dummy
#
@echo |y>>> Starting respawn test. The dummy will be destroyed and should respawn in 5 seconds.|n